        ],
        "summary": "Current account profile and its roles in the session's tenant",
        "tags": ["auth"]
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "title": "inova Auth Service",
    "description": "Signing in for the inova apps. The shapes of every answer below are also\nTypeScript types in `@inova/shared` (`AuthSession`, `AuthProfile`,\n`RecoveryStarted`, `ApiError`) — import them rather than copying.\n\n**Test portal:** auth `https://test-portal.whitenova.tech/auth/v1`, core API\n`https://test-portal.whitenova.tech/api/v1` (its own document at `/api/docs`).\n\n## The organisation (realm)\n\nEvery account belongs to one organisation; the same phone in two organisations\nis two unrelated accounts. Name it on every sign-in call — `login`,\n`activate`, `resend-code`, `recovery`, `recovery/confirm` — with\n`realm` (the organisation key, e.g. `demo`) or `brand` (the app's brand key,\nenough while the brand has one organisation). Without either, the server's\ndefault organisation is used.\n\n## Signing in and staying signed in\n\n1. `POST /auth/login` with `{ phone, password, realm }` (or `email`). The\n   answer is an `AuthSession`: an access token valid `expiresIn` seconds\n   (15 minutes) and a refresh token.\n2. Call the core API with `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` and\n   `X-Tenant-Id: <memberships[0].t>`.\n3. When the access token is about to expire, or a call answers 401, send\n   `POST /auth/refresh` with the refresh token and **store both new tokens**.\n   A refresh token works once: sending a spent one ends the whole session\n   everywhere. Refresh once at a time — let parallel calls wait for it.\n4. `POST /auth/logout` with the refresh token ends the session.\n\n## The first time: activation\n\nA manager creates the resident and an invite code goes out by SMS.\n`POST /auth/activate` with `{ identifier: <phone>, code, realm }` signs the\nresident in with `user.mustSetPassword: true`; then `POST /auth/password`.\nFive wrong codes cancel the code; `POST /auth/resend-code` sends a new one.\nThe screen never says how many tries are left.\n\n## Forgotten password\n\n`POST /auth/recovery` with `{ email }` (offered first) or `{ phone }` answers\n`202` with `expiresInMinutes` — always, whether or not the account exists.\nThen `POST /auth/recovery/confirm` with `{ token }` (from the e-mailed link)\nor `{ phone, code }`, plus the new password. Every session of the account\nends; sign in again.\n\n## Errors\n\nEvery error has the body `ApiError`: `{ statusCode, message, error }`.\n`message` lists the broken fields on a 400. A wrong password, an unknown\nphone and an account of another organisation all get the same 401 — show\none message for all. 429: too many tries from this address, wait a minute.\n\n## Test accounts (test portal)\n\nOrganisation `demo` (`realm: \"demo\"`), password `demo-resident`, sign in by phone:\n\n| Phone | Who |\n| --- | --- |\n| `+359881000101` | Петър Николов — owner of бл. 12 ап. 1 and garage Г1, with a household member and a dog |\n| `+359881000102` | Ралица Николова — co-owner of ап. 1 |\n| `+359881000103` | Калин Тодоров — tenant of ап. 3: no owner-only actions |\n| `+359881000002` | Георги Димитров — not activated: code `735026` (once; a reset of the test portal restores it) |\n\nA reset of the test portal puts these accounts back as listed. SMS and e-mail\nare not sent on the test portal yet: the activation code above is fixed, and\nfor recovery ask the backend team for the code.",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "contact": {}
  },
  "tags": [],
  "servers": [],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearer": {
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "type": "http"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "LoginDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "realm": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Organisation key"
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Brand key of the app"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "maria@inova.bg"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+359881000001"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova-owner"
          }
        },
        "required": ["password"]
      },
      "SessionUserDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "8d5e6c1e-3b0f-4c1a-9a51-5f0d6b7e2c11"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": null
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "+359881000101"
          },
          "fullName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Петър Николов"
          },
          "platformRole": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["super_admin"],
            "nullable": true,
            "example": null
          },
          "mustSetPassword": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": false,
            "description": "True right after activation: ask for a password"
          }
        },
        "required": ["id", "email", "phone", "fullName", "platformRole", "mustSetPassword"]
      },
      "SessionMembershipDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "t": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "2dd2d761-0b81-4cfd-9a30-0327933f188c",
            "description": "The organisation's id — send it as `X-Tenant-Id` to core-api"
          },
          "r": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "resident",
            "description": "Role key in the organisation"
          },
          "tenantKey": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "demo"
          },
          "tenantName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Demo Blok Management"
          }
        },
        "required": ["t", "r", "tenantKey", "tenantName"]
      },
      "AuthSessionDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "user": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionUserDto"
          },
          "memberships": {
            "description": "The session's own organisation, once per role; empty for a platform operator",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionMembershipDto"
            }
          },
          "accessToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6Ii4uLiJ9…",
            "description": "Bearer token"
          },
          "refreshToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "t.2dd2d761-0b81-4cfd-9a30-0327933f188c.r8Q…",
            "description": "Single use: `refresh` returns a new one; reusing an old one ends the whole session"
          },
          "expiresIn": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 900,
            "description": "Seconds the access token is valid"
          }
        },
        "required": ["user", "memberships", "accessToken", "refreshToken", "expiresIn"]
      },
      "ApiErrorDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "statusCode": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 401
          },
          "message": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            ],
            "example": "Invalid credentials",
            "description": "A list for 400 validation errors, one line per field; a sentence otherwise"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Unauthorized"
          }
        },
        "required": ["statusCode", "message", "error"]
      },
      "ActivateDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "realm": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Organisation key"
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Brand key of the app"
          },
          "identifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+359881000001",
            "description": "The account the code was sent to: its phone (E.164) or e-mail (B15)"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "482913",
            "description": "6-digit invite code from SMS/Viber"
          }
        },
        "required": ["identifier", "code"]
      },
      "ResendCodeDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "realm": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Organisation key"
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Brand key of the app"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+359881000001"
          }
        },
        "required": ["phone"]
      },
      "AcceptedDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["ok"],
            "example": "ok"
          }
        },
        "required": ["status"]
      },
      "RecoveryRequestDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "realm": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Organisation key"
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Brand key of the app"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "maria@inova.bg"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+359881000001"
          }
        }
      },
      "RecoveryStartedDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["ok"],
            "example": "ok"
          },
          "channel": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["email", "phone"],
            "example": "phone"
          },
          "expiresInMinutes": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 10,
            "description": "How long the link or code is valid"
          }
        },
        "required": ["status", "channel", "expiresInMinutes"]
      },
      "RecoveryConfirmDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "realm": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Organisation key"
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "inova",
            "description": "Brand key of the app"
          },
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The token from the e-mailed link"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+359881000001"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "482913",
            "description": "The code sent by SMS"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 8
          }
        },
        "required": ["password"]
      },
      "RefreshDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "refreshToken": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": ["refreshToken"]
      },
      "SetPasswordDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 8
          }
        },
        "required": ["password"]
      },
      "AuthProfileDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "user": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionUserDto"
          },
          "memberships": {
            "description": "The session's own organisation, once per role; empty for a platform operator",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionMembershipDto"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": ["user", "memberships"]
      }
    }
  }
}
